*** %s: other players are hidden until it ends. %s (Mission sync) stays with you.	*** %s: pemain lain disembunyikan sehingga ia tamat. %s (Penyegerakan misi) kekal bersama anda.
your partner	pasangan anda
*** %s: other players are hidden until it ends (your own story).	*** %s: pemain lain disembunyikan sehingga ia berakhir (cerita anda sendiri).
