Top bar: the dots open Help, Server and Player list. Chat opens the chat box (type / for the commands). Drag the bar to move it.	Bar atas: titik-titik tersebut membuka senarai Bantuan, Pelayan dan Pemain. Sembang membuka kotak sembang (taip / untuk arahan). Seret bar untuk menggerakkannya.
Server: connect to the default server, join or add custom servers (with an optional password, max 16 characters), host your own.	Pelayan: sambung ke pelayan lalai, sertai atau tambah pelayan tersuai (dengan kata laluan pilihan, maksimum 16 aksara), hoskan pelayan anda sendiri.
Player list: tap a player, then Mission sync. They get a popup with Accept / Decline. Synced players see each other on every mission (also in mission scenes) and share markers.	Senarai pemain: ketik pemain, kemudian Penyegerakan misi. Mereka akan mendapat tetingkap timbul dengan Terima / Tolak. Pemain yang disegerakkan akan bertemu antara satu sama lain pada setiap misi (juga dalam babak misi) dan berkongsi penanda.
Chat commands	Arahan sembang
Games (2.21)	Permainan (2.21)
/spawn [id|name] (or /v) any vehicle 400-611, /w [id|name|all] weapons, /fix, /flip, /heal, /armour	/spawn [id|nama] (atau /v) sebarang kenderaan 400-611, /w [id|nama|semua] senjata, /fix, /flip, /heal, /armour
/race 1-8 races with checkpoints and times, /job trucking|quarry|pizza|burger|cluckin|taxi|medic|firetruck, /dm war|grove|airport|minigun|sniper, /leave, /scores	/race 1-8 perlumbaan dengan pusat pemeriksaan dan masa, /job trak|kuari|piza|burger|kluckin|teksi|medik|trak bomba, /dm perang|grove|lapangan terbang|minigun|penembak tepat, /leave, /scores
Teleports everybody sees: /ls /sf /lv /chiliad /lsairport /sfairport /lvairport /desert /beach /strip /dam /area51 /pizza /burger /cluckin /barber /tattoo /gym /gymsf /gymlv /clothes /prolaps /victim /ammu /spray /transfender /locolow /waa /school /flightschool /boatschool /truck /quarry /emmet /home /gf /casino	Teleportasi yang dilihat oleh semua orang: /ls /sf /lv /chiliad /lsairport /sfairport /lvairport /desert /beach /strip /dam /area51 /pizza /burger /cluckin /barber /tattoo /gym /gymsf /gymlv /clothes /prolaps /victim /ammu /spray /transfender /locolow /waa /school /flightschool /boatschool /truck /quarry /emmet /home /gf /casino
Open world: /unlock (all cities, shops, food, gyms, barbers, tattoo, clothes, Ammu-Nation, Pay 'n' Spray, mod garages, schools, safe houses), /girlfriends	Dunia terbuka: /unlock (semua bandar, kedai, makanan, gim, tukang gunting rambut, tatu, pakaian, Ammu-Nation, Pay 'n' Spray, garaj mod, sekolah, rumah selamat), /girlfriends
