New Citizen - %s	Warga Baru - %s
%s%s - Lv %d	%s%s - Tahap %d
 (duty)	 (tugas)
[GPS] Route set: %s.	[GPS] Laluan ditetapkan: %s.
Hey there, citizen. Beautiful neon night in Mega Vil, isn't it?	Hai semua, warga. Malam neon yang indah di Mega Vil, bukan?
Oh! You startled me. Can I help you?	Oh! Awak mengejutkan saya. Boleh saya bantu?
Welcome to the future, friend. What do you need?	Selamat datang ke masa depan, kawan. Apa yang kau perlukan?
Hi! Don't mind me, just waiting for my hover bus.	Hai! Tak kisahlah, cuma tunggu bas hover saya.
Good to see a friendly face. The city's busy today.	Gembira melihat wajah yang peramah. Bandar ini sibuk hari ini.
Yo. You new around here? I can tell.	Awak baru di sini? Saya boleh tahu.
Careful, the holo ads are loud today. What's up?	Hati-hati, iklan holo sangat bising hari ini. Ada apa?
Hello! My drone is charging, so I've got a minute.	Helo! Dron saya sedang dicas, jadi saya ada masa sebentar.
Ask about the city	Tanya tentang bandar
Mega Vil used to be Los Santos. Then the towers went up and the holograms came on.	Mega Vil dahulunya Los Santos. Kemudian menara-menara itu dinaikkan dan hologram-hologram itu muncul.
City Hall has the Job Center. Everyone starts there - taxi, trucker, police, even pilot.	Dewan Bandaraya mempunyai Pusat Pekerjaan. Semua orang bermula di sana - teksi, pemandu lori, polis, malah juruterbang.
Paydays every half hour, straight to your bank. The Mega Bank pays interest too.	Hari gaji setiap setengah jam, terus ke bank anda. Mega Bank juga membayar faedah.
Stay in the greenzones if you want peace. Nobody can hurt you in there.	Kekallah di zon hijau jika kamu mahukan kedamaian. Tiada siapa yang boleh mencederakan kamu di sana.
Ask for directions	Minta arahan
Let me put it on your GPS. Follow the sky blue marker.	Biar saya letakkannya pada GPS awak. Ikut penanda biru langit.
It's not far. I'll send the route to your phone.	Ia tidak jauh. Saya akan hantar laluan ke telefon anda.
Easy. Check your GPS, I marked it.	Mudah. ​​Periksa GPS anda, saya telah menandakannya.
Head that way. Your phone has the route now.	Pergi ke sana. Telefon anda mempunyai laluannya sekarang.
Ask for a job tip	Minta tip kerja
Truckers make good money. Long routes pay the most.	Pemandu lori mengaut keuntungan yang lumayan. Laluan jauh membayar paling tinggi.
Pilots get the biggest pay, but you need level 2 first.	Juruterbang mendapat gaji terbesar, tetapi anda memerlukan tahap 2 terlebih dahulu.
Police need level 3 and two hours in the city. Then you can wear the badge.	Polis memerlukan tahap 3 dan dua jam di bandar. Kemudian awak boleh pakai lencana itu.
Double Pay Hour comes with the city events. Work then - everything pays twice.	Waktu Gaji Berganda disertakan dengan acara bandar. Bekerjalah kemudian - semuanya dibayar dua kali ganda.
Compliment them	Puji mereka
Aww, thank you! You made my day.	Aduh, terima kasih! Awak menceriakan hari saya.
Ha! You're too kind. Nice outfit yourself.	Ha! Awak terlalu baik. Pakaian awak cantik.
Thanks, citizen. Mega Vil needs more people like you.	Terima kasih, warganegara. Mega Vil memerlukan lebih ramai orang seperti anda.
Oh stop it. ...No, keep going.	Oh hentikan. ...Tidak, teruskan.
Ask about the news	Tanya tentang berita
Did you hear? A Holo Cash Drop hits the streets every so often. Free money!	Dengar tak? Holo Cash Drop sampai ke jalanan sekali-sekala. Wang percuma!
The Neon Night Festival at the Plaza is the best party in the city.	Festival Malam Neon di Plaza merupakan pesta terbaik di bandar ini.
Lottery tickets are $500. I never win, but you might.	Tiket loteri berharga $500. Saya tidak pernah menang, tetapi anda mungkin.
They say the holo towers pay $2,500 to whoever reaches them first.	Mereka kata menara holo membayar $2,500 kepada sesiapa yang sampai dahulu.
Take care out there!	Jaga diri di luar sana!
See you around, citizen.	Jumpa lagi, warga.
Stay safe in the neon.	Kekal selamat di dalam neon.
Bye! Watch out for drones.	Selamat tinggal! Berhati-hati dengan dron.
STOP EMOTE	BERHENTI EMOTE
Talk	Bercakap
Nevermind	Tak kisahlah
