[TAXI] A passenger is waiting (yellow marker). Stop next to them, then drive to the fare marker.	[TAXI] Seorang penumpang sedang menunggu (penanda kuning). Berhenti di sebelah mereka, kemudian pandu ke penanda tambang.
[TAXI] Your passenger got hurt - a new one is waiting.	[TAXI] Penumpang anda cedera - penumpang baharu sedang menunggu.
[TAXI] Your car is full.	[TAXI] Kereta anda penuh.
[TAXI] Passenger: \"Where is your taxi?\" (get in a car)	[TAXI] Penumpang: \"Di mana teksi anda?\" (masuk kereta)
[TAXI] Passenger in. Drive to the fare marker and stop there.	[TAXI] Penumpang masuk. Pandu ke penanda tambang dan berhenti di sana.
[TAXI] Your passenger is out of the car - pick them up again.	[TAXI] Penumpang anda telah keluar dari kereta - jemput mereka semula.
