{FFA500}LUMBERJACK: {FFFFFF}Welcome to the Timber job (woodcutting level %d). Cut %d trees, load the logs in the pickup, sell them at the storage.	{FFA500}PEMBALONG: {FFFFFF}Selamat datang ke kerja Balak (tahap pemotongan kayu %d). Tebang %d pokok, muatkan kayu balak ke dalam trak pikap, jualkannya di stor.
