Your pickup is gone - the timber went with it. /quitjob, then /timber.	Pikap anda telah hilang - kayu itu telah hilang bersamanya. /quitjob, kemudian /timber.
Bring the pickup with the timber to the storage.	Bawa trak pikap bersama kayu balak ke stor.
